error[E4101]: cannot borrow `bytes` as mutable because it is also borrowed as shared
 --> tests/borrows/fail/E4101_vec_slice_then_push.tarn:5:5
  |
4 |     view := bytes.as_slice()
  |             ----- shared borrow of `bytes` starts here
5 |     bytes.push(u8(2))
  |     ^^^^^ mutable borrow conflicts here
6 |     print(view.len())
  |           ---------- the borrow is still used here
